      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "immediately after section 3B, the following new section 3c: \"Director 3c. (1) The Director General may, in writing, General may delegate to any authorized telecommunication delegate. officer, subject to such conditions and restrictions as the Director General may impose, the performance of any duty or function imposed or conferred on him under this Act: Provided that any delegation under this section shall not prevent the Director General from himself performing that duty or function in any case where it appears to him expedient to do so. (2) Any authorized telecommunication officer performing any of the duties or functions delegated to him under subsection (1) shall have regard to the matters specified in section 3B (2).\"."
      }
